#-------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stream layer mapping table for SkyWater SKY130 (sky130A)
#
# Same four-column format as the IHP sg13g2.map this workbench already
# reads: <name>  <types>  <GDS layer>  <GDS datatype>
#
# Layer/datatype numbers are the published sky130A values. This table is a
# packaging-oriented subset covering the routing metals, their vias, the
# pad opening and the cell boundary.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------
